      <p class="pt">You asked to see what a batch costs beyond its run. All figures are tokens written: input plus cache writes, with cached reads left out.</p>
      <div class="pt">
        <p>Preparation, about 3.65M:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>The walk probe, which tried every way to keep your P-48 in walk: 1.13M.</li>
          <li>The checker probe, which traced the six checker defects and fixed them in a copy: 0.88M.</li>
