          <li>The Fable review of the plan: about 0.7M.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="pt">
        <p>The run, 4.44M, against batch 14's 4.82M:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Workers, who build the fixes: 1.81M.</li>
          <li>Skeptics, who check and correct them: 1.49M.</li>
          <li>The gather, which lands the fixes on main and writes the record: 469K.</li>
          <li>The review beside the gate: 408K.</li>
          <li>The gate and the commit: 263K.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="pt">
        <p>Landing so far, about 0.76M:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>The post-batch review: 0.51M.</li>
          <li>The skill writer, folding the changes into the skill, two rounds: 0.17M.</li>
          <li>The cold read of that edit: 0.08M.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="pt">So about 8.9M from first probe to this page, against about 9M for batch 14. The run is about half of it. My own tokens in this session aren't counted in any of these.</p>
      <p class="pt">Per fix the run cost 1.11M, against batch 14's 0.96M: batch 15 had four fixes where 14 had five, and fix L wrote 473K against its plan's 0.3M.</p>
    </div>
